---
description: Kinoquence project instructions for Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `CONTRIBUTING.md` before code changes. Kinoquence's portable storyboard contract is in `docs/SCHEMA.md`. Do not overwrite approved stories with unreviewed model drafts. Preserve asset licences and source records. For Python changes run `python -m unittest discover -s tests -v`. For Remotion changes, run the TypeScript check and a sample render when dependencies are available; state clearly when they are not. Never claim universal model support or quality benchmarks without reproducible tests.
